  "details": "Mozilla Firefox is an open-source web browser, designed for standards compliance, performance, and portability.  \n\nSecurity Fix(es):  \n\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the JavaScript: GC component (CVE-2026-118007)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the XPCOM component (CVE-2026-118021)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Text component (CVE-2026-118024)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Race condition, use-after-free in the DOM: File component (CVE-2026-118019)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Audio/Video component (CVE-2026-124860)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Site isolation issue in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124914)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the DOM: Core & HTML component (CVE-2026-124869)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Privilege escalation in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124854)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Layout: Positioned component (CVE-2026-124877)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to use-after-free in the Widget: Gtk component (CVE-2026-124917)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Incorrect boundary conditions in the DOM: Selection component (CVE-2026-124891)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Use-after-free in the Graphics: Canvas2D component (CVE-2026-124857)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Information disclosure in the Security: RLBox component (CVE-2026-124941)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124855)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Spoofing issue in the Security component (CVE-2026-124934)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Graphics: Text component (CVE-2026-124853)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape in the DOM: Navigation component (CVE-2026-124905)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Sandbox escape due to incorrect boundary conditions in the Storage: Cache API component (CVE-2026-124859)\n  * firefox: thunderbird: Us